{"last_link_id": 616, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["### 🎥 Motion-Controlled T2V Workflow  \n`Use your own video to guide motion in text-to-video generation`\n\nThis workflow allows you to upload a **reference video** to guide the motion and timing of your generated output. Perfect for matching character animation to real human movement.\n\n🛠️ How it works:\n\n1. 📹 Upload your own **reference video** into the `Upload Video` node  \n  → This could be a clip of yourself acting out a scene or performing a motion\n\n2. 📝 Write your **text prompt** as usual  \n  → Focus on character details, background, lighting, and overall style  \n  → You **don’t need to describe camera motion** — it’s already embedded in the control video\n\n3. 🔁 The model uses the uploaded video to extract motion, while applying your prompt to generate a new cinematic result\n\n📌 This is ideal for:\n- Character animation  \n- Matching action or gesture timing  \n- Custom motion reference for fine-tuned outputs\n\n🧠 Tips: \n- Match the framing of your character to the composition you want in the final result\n\n---\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "## READ ME", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [1183.504150390625, 472.210693359375], "pos": [-1803.794189453125, -2878.973876953125], "id": 303, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["### 🔄 Swap DWpose with Other ControlNets and use a custom reference image.\n`Use different ControlNets to change how motion or structure is guided`\n\nYou don’t have to use DWpose — you can swap in other ControlNets and now **use your own reference image** for more control and consistency:\n\n- 🌊 Depth  \n- 🖊️ Lineart  \n- 🧍 OpenPose  \n\n📌 For lip sync or better facial detail:  \nUse Open pose with a **close-up video** and a **custom ref image** for best results.\n\n📌 In the upload image node just upload your ref image and watch it come to life!\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "NOTE", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [645.8276977539062, 337.3891906738281], "pos": [-173.0615997314453, -2730.7373046875], "id": 304, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "wan_t5_model", "slot_index": 0, "links": [559, 563], "label": "wan_t5_model", "type": "WANTEXTENCODER", "localized_name": "wan_t5_model"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors", "bf16", "offload_device", "disabled"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadWanVideoT5TextEncoder", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [615.1904296875, 191.6869659423828], "pos": [-2145.00390625, -2081.609619140625], "id": 11, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper", "ver": "3869b0482b615b6a8fd6f346467c5ef6627eed72", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadWanVideoT5TextEncoder"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text_embeds", "links": [562], "label": "text_embeds", "type": "WANVIDEOTEXTEMBEDS", "localized_name": "text_embeds"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-1078.468017578125, -1865.9659423828125], "widgets_values": ["", true, false, "gpu"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "t5", "link": 563, "label": "t5", "type": "WANTEXTENCODER", "localized_name": "t5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "model_to_offload", "link": 564, "label": "model_to_offload", "type": "WANVIDEOMODEL", "localized_name": "model_to_offload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 329, "type": "WanVideoTextEncodeSingle", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "WanVideoTextEncodeSingle"}, "order": 24}, {"outputs": [{"name": "vae", "slot_index": 0, "links": [533, 552], "label": "vae", "type": "WANVAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors", "bf16"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "WanVideoVAELoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [572.1995239257812, 140.50462341308594], "pos": [-671.72204589